<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DSC said cut by Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DSC said cut by Goldman.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs &amp; Co dropped DSC Communications Corp from its recommended list, according to a Goldman source on Wednesday, and is now rated a market outperform.</p>
<p>-- The stock was being bid at between 22-7/8 and 21-1/2 ahead of the opening of trading.</p>
</text>
